# Session library

Library entries are reusable intent templates. Coaches can still edit, duplicate, and write a custom session. A dynamic target, when it exists, is an expression plus a snapshot. It does not remove the manual target field.

Do not collapse categories or rename ids that published programmes already store. Search and filters must keep finding the current volume-builder and hybrid-engine sessions.

Formula fields wait on `docs/contracts/prescription-engine.md`.
